{
  "entry": "greeting",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "text": "Bren turns a bent hinge beneath the light. 'Swords get songs. Hinges keep winter outside.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_life",
          "text": "Tell me about life here.",
          "next": "life"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_concern",
          "text": "Is anything on your mind?",
          "next": "concern",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "remember_a",
          "text": "How did our earlier discussion turn out?",
          "next": "outcome_a",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "remember_b",
          "text": "How did our earlier discussion turn out?",
          "next": "outcome_b",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_lesson",
          "text": "Could you teach me a recipe?",
          "next": "lesson"
        },
        {
          "id": "goodbye",
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "life",
      "text": "'The old watchpost iron is worth saving. Clean metal, careful heat, no fancy promises. I teach anyone willing to listen.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "personal_topic",
          "text": "Show Bren a piece of iron ore.",
          "next": "personal",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "item",
              "id": "iron_ore",
              "value": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "life_back",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concern",
      "text": "'The council wants polished gate fittings for its procession. The school needs a stove door. Which gets my afternoon?'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "decide_a",
          "text": "Repair the school stove first.",
          "next": "outcome_a",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "standing",
              "id": "ironward",
              "value": 3
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Bren remembered your advice: Repair the school stove first."
        },
        {
          "id": "decide_b",
          "text": "Finish the fittings, then use the fee for the stove.",
          "next": "outcome_b",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "standing",
              "id": "ironward",
              "value": 3
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Bren remembered your advice: Finish the fittings, then use the fee for the stove."
        },
        {
          "id": "decline_concern",
          "text": "Pick whichever is cheaper and stop asking me.",
          "next": "",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "bren_decision",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "standing",
              "id": "ironward",
              "value": -4
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Bren remembered your refusal: You told him to pick the cheaper job."
        },
        {
          "id": "concern_back",
          "text": "I need to think about it.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome_a",
      "text": "'The procession can shine tomorrow.' Children bring Bren a thank-you drawing covered in improbable flames.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outcome_a_back",
          "text": "Until next time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome_b",
      "text": "'Then I need that promise in writing.' Bren secures the school repair fee before accepting the council's order.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outcome_b_back",
          "text": "Until next time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "text": "'I can teach you iron armor. Take your time with the measurements. A recipe is a promise you make to whoever uses the result.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "learn_recipe",
          "text": "Study the recipe together.",
          "next": "greeting",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "recipe",
              "id": "iron_armor_recipe",
              "state": "unknown"
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "recipe",
              "id": "iron_armor_recipe"
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "You learned iron armor through patient instruction."
        },
        {
          "id": "known_recipe",
          "text": "I already know this recipe; let us compare notes.",
          "next": "life",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "recipe",
              "id": "iron_armor_recipe",
              "state": "known"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "lesson_back",
          "text": "Another time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "personal",
      "text": "'See that seam? Good material, if you clean it carefully.' Bren returns the ore after showing you what to look for.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "personal_back",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    }
